pico-8 cartridge // http://www.pico-8.com
version 43
__lua__
-- note effect timing regression cart (sfx 8..12; the suite checks 9, 10
-- and 12 -- the slide and the drop sit too close to a key boundary for the
-- start delay of PICO-8, which changes from run to run)
-- PICO-8 works an effect out once per tick and holds it, the slide moves
-- linearly in pitch and the arpeggios step every 4 / 8 ticks; read with
-- tests/tools/wavnotes.py, recorded from PICO-8 0.2.7 with
-- platforms/macos/oracle_audio.sh --record
--   8 slide over 32 ticks   9 fast arpeggio   10 slow arpeggio
--  11 drop                 12 fade in (its first tick is silent)
export("timing_%d.wav")
